  "description": "Headless, renderer-independent window manager engine: applies Kazo.Os.Windowing.Abstractions commands to authoritative window state (focus, z-order, geometry, modality, lifecycle) and emits deterministic events.",
  "id": "Kazo.Os.Windowing.Core",
